{"id": "cg-withtests-merge_intervals", "family": "code_supplied", "spec": "code_generator", "latency_s": 0.0, "raw": {"ok": true, "answer": "validated supplied code (not generated): 2 funcs, 0 classes", "tool_output": {"generated": false, "parsed": true, "functions": ["merge_intervals", "test_ok"], "classes": [], "lines": 14, "code_chars": 327, "code_sha256": "26d5c5ad1c85ec04b4b853160572d2d16e16fe95be2bb95f91db7ea9fb5fba02", "code": "def merge_intervals(iv):\n    out = []\n    for a, b in sorted(iv):\n        if out and a <= out[-1][1]:\n            out[-1][1] = max(out[-1][1], b)\n        else:\n            out.append([a, b])\n    return out\n\n\ndef test_ok():\n    assert merge_intervals([[1,3],[2,6],[8,10]]) == [[1,6],[8,10]]\n    assert merge_intervals([]) == []\n"}}}
